{"kind":"assert","text":"Rule from hugh, 2026-10-05: no agent installs packages in a checkout to run a tool. Tooling probes (wrangler, playwright or any other) run a pinned version from a scratch directory, for example npx wrangler@4.147.0 in /tmp, so package.json and the lockfile change only in a reviewed commit. Evidence: an unreviewed npm i --save-dev wrangler@latest ran with the shared checkout ~/play/artroom as its working directory at 07:47 Eastern today (npm log), the same change appeared on 2026-10-04, and a Codex session did the same on 2026-10-01; each time it dirtied the shared checkout and blocked landings. The change is preserved under the named stash planner-preserve-stray-wrangler-devdep-2026-10-05-0750 and is not wanted on main. The rule is added to AGENTS.md on main.","body":{"evidence":"npm log 2026-10-05T11:47:47Z: npm i --save-dev wrangler@latest with cwd ~/play/artroom; same change on 2026-10-04; a Codex session did the same on 2026-10-01","rule":"tooling-probes-pinned-from-scratch","source":"hugh, 2026-10-05 07:58 Eastern"}}